SUMMARY:Tuesday & Thursday Yoga Online
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Vi for a beginner friendly yoga flow
 . Kick off your day by settling into your body and taking a moment on the 
 mat.\n\nWe will be doing morning yoga online via zoom.\n\nJoin Vi on your 
 mat for beginner friendly yoga flows. Designed to help you drop into your 
 day with intention. Take a moment on your mat for yourself.\n\nThese are D
 onation based events. All donations go to helping us continue to offer our
  services to the community locally and online.\n\nDonations are not requir
 ed but always apprechiated.\nAverage donation amount $15 - $20
