SUMMARY:Yoga in the Park with Didge & Sound Healing Magic!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nStretch\, breathe\, and unwind beneath th
 e trees.\n\nJoin us for a deeply restorative outdoor yoga experience desig
 ned to help you slow down\, release tension\, and reconnect with yourself.
  This gentle practice is accessible to most bodies and experience levels\,
  offering plenty of space to relax\, restore\, and simply be.\n\nThis gath
 ering is made especially unique by the presence of Wolfgang of the [Lumino
 us Now](https://theluminousnow.com/)\, who will be sharing the grounding s
 ounds of the didgeridoo throughout the practice. Its deep\, ancient vibrat
 ions create a powerful sense of connection and calm\, inviting the body in
 to profound relaxation. For those who wish\, individual sound healing with
  the didgeridoo will also be available.\n\nWe'll gather on a platform in t
 he park\, surrounded by the beauty of nature and the warmth of our welcomi
 ng yoga community. Cool morning air\, birdsong\, gentle movement\, and imm
 ersive sound combine to create a truly nourishing start to the day.\n\nPle
 ase bring a yoga mat and any props that support your practice.\n\nThe clas
 s is weather permitting. If you plan to attend\, please email Randi at [li
 minalyoga@gmail.com](mailto:liminalyoga@gmail.com) so you can receive upda
 tes in the event of a weather-related cancellation.\n\nDrop-in: $20. Class
  pass discounts are available. Wolfgang also accepts tips for his sound of
 fering.
