SUMMARY:Tarot Practice!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Let's get together again and practice o
 ur Tarot card and pendulums.**\n**This is for beginners through advanced r
 eaders to practice their skills.**\n\n**Everyone will get to do a reading.
  There will be extra decks and pendulums if you do not have some. We will 
 try different layouts and share our experiences. All fun!**\n\n**We will h
 ave an introduction to tarot discussion for the first 20 minutes then most
  of the time will be just practice\, so come on by.**\n\n**See you there!*
 *\n**Shaman Phil**
